# The drawing (an extension): the extrusion of path_extrude, File >
# Drawing Sheet shows the sheet's screen; the sheet goes to A2, the
# scale to 1:2, first angle, a title, and File > Export Drawing writes
# it.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
menu File|Drawing Sheet...
tw
twmove 307 105
twdown L 307 105
twup L 307 105
twmove 325 145
twdown L 325 145
twup L 325 145
edit 1:2
twmove 172 165
twdown L 172 165
twup L 172 165
twmove 181 235
twdown L 181 235
twup L 181 235
edit PLATE
tw
file $tmp/sheet.svg
menu File|Export Drawing...
save
